  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">APC Association for Progressive Communications 2024-2027</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">APC Association for Progressive Communications 2024-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">APC&apos;s goal is to develop innovative opportunities for vulnerable people to access the internet. The organization works in parallel for a rights-based approach to the access to and governance of the internet and practices using a holistic approach that also includes the safety and protection of human rights defenders from a feminist perspective.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">APCs m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att utveckla innovativa m&#xf6;jligheter f&#xf6;r utsatta m&#xe4;nniskor att f&#xe5; tillg&#xe5;ng till internet. Organisationen arbetar parallellt f&#xf6;r ett r&#xe4;ttighetsbaserat f&#xf6;rh&#xe5;llningss&#xe4;tt f&#xf6;r tillg&#xe5;ngen till och styrningen av internet och praktiserar anv&#xe4;nder ett holistiskt arbetss&#xe4;tt som ocks&#xe5; innefattar m&#xe4;nniskor&#xe4;ttsf&#xf6;rsvarares s&#xe4;kerhet och skydd ur ett feministiskt perspektiv.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Association for Progressive Communication&apos;s objective is to develop innovative opportunities for vulnerable people to access the internet. The organization works in parallel for a rights-based approach to the access to and governance of the internet and practices using a holistic approach that also includes the safety and protection of human rights defenders from a feminist perspective.</narrative>
